COMMENT ON COLUMN "skill_compositions"."definition" IS '组合定义(JSONB)，包含步骤和依赖关系';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "skill_compositions"."source_path" IS 'COMPOSITION.yaml源文件路径';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "skill_compositions"."template_ref" IS '引用的模板名称';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "skill_compositions"."is_template" IS '是否为模板';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "skill_compositions"."sync_status" IS '同步状态：synced/pending/error';
